# Step 4: Revision  

â€¢ This is the most advanced step because it requires taste and judgement  
â€¢ Hooks fail for one of 5 reasons. Assess which one it is, and iterate accordingly:  
â€¢ A lack of clarity  
â€¢ A lack of curiosity  
â€¢ A lack of originality  
â€¢ A lack of perceived value  
â€¢ A lack of emotion  
  
  
