Scripting: Hook &  
Hook = first 5 seconds of your video.  
Goal of a hook: Make viewer want to keep watching  
A hook is not just what you say (writing), but...  
â€¢ How you say it (tonality)  
â€¢ How you show it (visuals & editing)  
â€¢ How it feels (music)  
  
  
<!-- Page 33 of 54 -->  
  
\>  
Scripting: Hook &  

# Step 1: Specificity  

â€¢ Write down your ideal viewer  
â€¢ What problems/interests/desires do they have? (Make it ULTRA specific)  
â€¢ Convey your point in the most specific terms possible  
â€¢ Instead of "How to get rich" â†’ "How to make 10k/mo as a broke 19 year old college student'  
â–  This is what evokes emotion, trust, authenticity  
  
  
<!-- Page 34 of 54 -->  
  
\>  
Scripting: Hook &  

# Step 2: Find winners  

â€¢ Find winning hook concepts  
â€¢ No need to reinvent the wheel; all great creators use hooks that are already validated by the algorithm  
â€¢ Find these hooks by scrolling intentionally and looking for outliers  
â€¢ Use your unique voice to combine your topic with the underlying mechanisms/principles of winning hooks  
  
  
